{
  "slug": "stackpilot",
  "name": "Stackpilot",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Sprint orchestration for Claude Code. Describe a feature, get production-ready code through an automated design→spec→plan→code→QA\npipeline. Drives Claude Code's native Agent tool for multi-agent execution with worktree isolation.\n\nIncludes 3 portable methodology skills usable standalone:\n• TDD Development — RED-GREEN-REFACTOR cycle with 4-phase root cause investigation\n• QA 12 Dimensions — two-stage code review + 12-dimension scenario test coverage\n• Architecture Review — codebase pattern analysis → decisive choice → implementation blueprint",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 hook**, `SessionStart`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install stackpilot@claude-community` from `9aoyang/stackpilot`.\n\nEnglish | 中文\n\nSprint orchestration for Claude Code. Describe a feature, get production-ready code through an automated design→spec→plan→code→QA\npipeline. Drives Claude Code's native Agent tool for multi-agent execution with worktree isolation.\n\nIncludes 3 portable methodology skills usable standalone:\n• TDD Development — RED-GREEN-REFACTOR cycle with 4-phase root cause investigation\n• QA 12 Dimensions — two-stage code review + 12-dimension scenario test coverage\n• Architecture Review — codebase pattern analysis → decisive choice → implementation blueprint",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
